{"sections":[{"slug":"内范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"内范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">内范畴</span> (1-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"内范畴 (1-范畴论)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">内范畴</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是范畴</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/内部观点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内部</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/严格1-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">即严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/一阶语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">一阶理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">在范畴中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">合适的概念是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">完备</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Segal空间","text":"Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间范畴的内范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间</span> $X\\in\\mathsf{Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的道路范畴是拓扑空间范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的内范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其对象集为</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">态射集为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">不限长度的</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">道路空间</span> $\\bigcup_{l&gt;0}\\operatorname{Hom}([0,l],X)$. <span lang=\"zh\">当然</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射的起点和终点即是道路的起点和终点</span>.</p>\n<h3>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">所谓</span> <strong>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">即是光滑流形范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mfd}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的内群胚</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}